gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Welcome to TEAM ROCKET!\p"
	.string "So you're one of those who\n"
	.string "were selected to be part of\l"
	.string "the FIVE ISLAND platoon, right?\p"
	.string "I'm ARCHER, GIOVANNI's top ADMIN.\n"
	.string "and right-hand man…\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This…\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "…is a real POKÉMON and what\n"
	.string "you should aspire to control.\p"
	.string "Well… {PAUSE 60}I hope you're not\n"
	.string "one of these mediocre grunts who\l"
	.string "are satisfied with EKANS or RATTATA.\p"
	.string "Insubordination and poor attitude are\n"
	.string "taken very seriously here…\l"
	.string "Keep this in mind.\p"
	.string "That said, it's time for some paperwork.\p"
	.string "Don't worry… {PAUSE 45} we don't ask\n"
	.string "for legal documents.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Prologo::
	.string "End of the 20th century…\p"
	.string "The KANTO region is in the midst\n"
	.string "of a transition designed to bring\l"
	.string "prosperity.\p"
	.string "The GREAT WAR left the region in ruins\n"
	.string "3 years ago. In these circumstances,\l"
	.string "LANCE and the ELITE 4 took over the\l"
	.string "post-war government, initiating a\l"
	.string "new era in terms of development…\p"
	.string "{PAUSE 80}"
	.string "But not everyone was happy with\n"
	.string "the new government, interpreting\l"
	.string "its rise to power as a government\l"
	.string "takeover, exploiting the fragility\l"
	.string "of the region after the war.\p"
	.string "{PAUSE 80}"
	.string "This gave rise to independent\n"
	.string "organized crime outfits, such as\l"
	.string "the FUCHSIA bikers, who were\l"
	.string "trying to recover the pre-war KANTO.\p"
	.string	"{PAUSE 100}"
	.string	"Among all these organizations,\n"
	.string "the most respected, best structured,\l"
	.string "and most influential is TEAM ROCKET,\l"
	.string "with GIOVANNI as the LEADER.\p"
	.string	"{PAUSE 100}"
	.string	"They are in the process of recruiting\n"
	.string	"young trainers to do their\l"
	.string "“dirty work” and earn extra\l"
	.string "money to fund their projects.{PAUSE 80}\p"
	.string "In this situation, you decided to enlist.\p"
	.string "$"		

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "You only have to register a name,\n"
	.string "which will be your identity here.$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "You only have to register a name,\n"
	.string "which will be your identity here.$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So… {PAUSE 60} you are\n{PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PAUSE 50}This is our LEADER, GIOVANNI.\p"
	.string "You will not find a better or wiser\n"
	.string "trainer in the entire KANTO region…\p"
	.string "Only top ROCKETS have access\n"
	.string "to him.\p"
	.string "If you really want to rise in this\n"
	.string "organization, you must perform well\l"
	.string "on each mission that is entrusted to\l"
	.string "you, without shortcuts or cheating.\p"
	.string "Only then may you one day be able to\n"
	.string "meet our LEADER in person.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "{PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "You are summoned for the presentation\n"
	.string "and delivery of initial POKÉMON on\l"
	.string "CHRONO ISLAND WAREHOUSE, at 5:00 pm.\p"
	.string "A world of corruption, fraud, and\n"
	.string "hypocrisy awaits you.\p"
	.string "Get ready to see your beloved\n"
	.string "KANTO from a different perspective.\p"
	.string "Let's begin!\p"
	.string "$"
